{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Propagate JVM-fatal hook failures without waiting behind arbitrary cleanup.** After catching `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, the loop continues invoking every remaining end hook. If a later hook blocks, the fatal never reaches the worker or invocation caller. Rethrow JVM-fatal failures immediately, or make subsequent best-effort cleanup bounded.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77xM8S","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":114,"observation_digest":"c0348218b7bddc5d99b45bafaec2ed50c9715a0b814e7c250486536e5cb01fc5","observation_id":"aro_v1_ya2iegfxxxof3gnulox25qxnkd","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T20:48:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_x7jz3p7qev5bxz3oyirpg4lplp","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"b882ea7c57a688d35a0eb694629d494a98769c57","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ppl53hxby4qx27763ds3ztxmnq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T20:48:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
